OL,3,GNEWSAStormont to review trials of the
OL,4,Afacts after Eleanor Donaldson case
OL,5,
OL,6,FStormont's justice and health ministers
OL,7,Fhave launched a joint review of the
OL,8,Flegal framework on trials of the facts
OL,9,Fin the wake of the Donaldson trial.
OL,11,FEleanor Donaldson, wife of convicted
OL,12,Fsex offender Jeffrey Donaldson, had
OL,13,Ffaced a trial of the facts after being
OL,14,Ffound unfit for a conventional trial on
OL,15,Fmental health grounds.
OL,17,FThe ministers will appoint an external
OL,18,Freviewer with the review aiming to
OL,19,Flaunch in late October and conclude by
OL,20,Fthe end of February 2027.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
